"P761155119" "We've got reports of some Clockwork down at the old abandoned {LOCALE_NAME} warehouse complex. Sources say they're using it as a staging area for a massive attack against the city. {HeroName}, we've never heard of the Clockwork trying anything this bold! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>It's absolutely imperative that you go to {LOCALE_NAME} and shut down the Clockwork plot!</A>"
